  The article says Ravikumar died on the way to the hospital (doctors said he died en route), but the reel_script and slides_spec say he died at the scene (சம்பவ இடத்திலேயே). The slide and caption repeat this error.
  The caption states the date as 'நேற்று (நவம்பர் 12)', a specific date not present in the article.
  The reel_script says the Tiruppur businessman died while the slides say 'சம்பவ இடத்திலேயே உயிரிழந்தார', contradicting the article's account of how and where he died.
  The article says the accident was a car colliding with a bus ('பேருந்து மீது கார் மோதிய') in the lead, but the body text says a cargo vehicle (சரக்கு வாகனம்); the draft uses the cargo vehicle version, which is consistent with the body, but the reel_script omits the mention of the bus, so the important fact of what was hit is not reconciled.
  The article says Krishnavéni is 60 and Ravikumar 56, and that Atishya (son) is 23, which the draft has right; however the article also says the family was returning from Thrissur to Tiruppur, which the reel_script states correctly.
